control: An identifier is unique within its scope
removes: an account's scope is read as the base rules rather than its own, so its own rules are unknown to it and the base policy's identifiers taken
packages: ./ui/internal/api
tests: TestAnIdentifierComesBackInItsScopeAndBesideTheOther
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

